  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(6f)+(-2g)+(-15h)\n$$\n\nCounting off the terms:\n\n- the first term is $6f,$\n\n- the second term is $-2g,$\n\n- the third term is $-15h.$\n\nIn particular, we are interested in the third term. The third term is $-15h.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
